# 🏠 HostelSync

**TGPDS-03 · Web & App Development**

A unified hostel operations platform that replaces fragmented registers and WhatsApp chaos with digital workflows — gate pass approvals, parent SMS alerts, real-time room allocation, and mess menu voting, all in one place.

---

## 🚨 Problem Statement

Hostel wardens today manage everything manually:

- Attendance tracked in physical registers  
- Gate passes approved through WhatsApp messages  
- Visitor logs maintained in notebooks  
- Mess feedback scattered across group chats  
- Room allocations handled over phone calls  

❗ This creates operational chaos:
- Lost records  
- Delayed approvals  
- No accountability  
- Zero visibility for parents or administration  

---

## ✅ Solution

**HostelSync** is a centralized hostel management platform that digitizes every touchpoint of hostel administration.

---

## 🚀 Core Features

### 🪪 Digital Gate Pass Workflow
- Students submit gate pass requests digitally  
- Wardens approve or deny in one click  
- Parents receive automatic SMS on departure & return  

---

### 📲 Parent SMS & Room Management
- Instant SMS notifications to parents  
- Real-time room allocation system  
- Live room status (occupied / vacant / maintenance)  

---

### ⚠️ Complaint Escalation System
- Students raise complaints  
- SLA-based tracking  
- Automatic escalation on delay  

---

### 🍽 Mess Menu Voting
- Weekly voting system  
- Real-time results  
- Data-driven mess planning  

---

### 📊 Operations Dashboard
- Single-screen admin control panel  
- Pending gate passes  
- SMS logs  
- Complaint tracking  
- Room status overview  

---

